  "body": "TAG review included a request to avoid 'blacklist' as it can be offensive. https://github.com/w3ctag/spec-reviews/issues/139#issuecomment-257509432 \r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blacklist_(computing) includes related terms 'Block list', and 'access control'.\r\n\r\nSome initial alternative ideas:\r\n- Access Control List\r\n- Block List\r\n- Exclude List",
